{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手鄧麗欣（Stephy）接受森美、DJ阿正及Elsie主持電台節目訪問宣傳新碟《Tathātā》，她表示碟名取之梵文：「最初諗個中文意思先嘅，想成張碟係講『三際一如』，就係講緊過去、現在、未來本質上係一樣嘅意思，所以取之『一如』嚟搵個名，</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T13:21:51.923069+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T13:01:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T13:18:20.552354+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T13:18:20.552354+00:00","content_hash":"7fe079e3e578c9f307e9f79ab63ed1e98271df1f101b7f7a398f0af169fbe39a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}